        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion N3, Scalloped Two Piece Basket Grab Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe uniquely shaped handle gives this solid brass handleset an airiness that elevates it from the mundane to the stunningly beautiful. It is available with a matching lever for the interior trim or you can choose your own. Fusion hardware's Basket Grab handleset is good for doors 1-3/8 inches to 2 inches thick and is available for doors with either a 2-3/8 inch backset or a 2-3/4 inch backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Beveled Edged Solid Brass Handleset Fusion N3:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Bump resistant cylinder.</li> \r\n<li>Solid brass SC1 keyway and 5 pin system with self lubricating solid brass plug & housing.</li>\r\n<li>High security strike.</li> \r\n<li>Reversible latch bolts for inside and outside swing.</li>\r\n<li>Minimal parts for easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>Matching latch, strike and screws for excellent appearance.</li>\r\n<li>Beveled interior screws with single slot for improved visual.</li>\r\n<li>No unsightly or difficult-to-inset set screws are used.</li>\r\n<li>Dual spring assist to eliminate \"knob wobble\" found in lesser products.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Fusion Basket Grab Door Entry Handle Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Outside Plate Length: 12-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Plate Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Trim Plate Length: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Trim Plate Width: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Deadbolt Length: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Deadbolt Width: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 5-1/2\" on center door boring.</li>\r\n<li>Center of latch bore to center of bottom thrubolt for handle:  8-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is operated by a key on the outside and a thumb turn on the inside while the handle underneath the deadbolt is operated by a thumb latch on the outside and either a knob or a lever on the inside.</li>\r\n<br>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> For looks only. They are non-locking and non-latching. They are used as a pull or to match trim.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The finish for the inside knob or lever you choose will match the outside finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Two Piece Basket Grab Scalloped Handleset, Fusion N3",
                "description": "Two Piece Basket Grab Scalloped Handleset Fusion N3 - The uniquely shaped basket handle is the center piece of this two piece Fusion Hardware handleset. Elaborately decorative without being ornate, this solid brass handleset is beautiful. It is available with a matching lever for the interior trim or you can choose your own. Fusion hardware's Basket Grab handleset is good for doors 1-3/8 inches to 2 inches thick and is available for doors with either a 2-3/8 inch backset or a 2-3/4 inch backset.",
                "keywords": "FUS-N3, fusion hardware N3, fusion hardware scalloped two piece basket grab handlesets, scalloped two piece handlesets, fusion scalloped two piece collections, solid brass handlesets, single cylinder handlesets, fusion hardware N3 basket grab handlesets, beveled edged handlesets,"
            },
